Brand brand kit for editors
title end

paragraph start
An editor receives the logo set, templates, overlay set, thumbnail template, do and do not pairs and the file naming rules. Fonts go only where the licence allows sharing.
paragraph end

paragraph start
The kit says in one page which file to use for which job, so an editor never has to guess.
paragraph end

